        "html": "<article style=\"width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111827,#1f2937);border:1px solid #f59e0b66;color:#f8fafc;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px\"><div style=\"width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fbbf24,#b45309);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:900\">BH</div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fbbf24;font-weight:800\">Person profile</div><h1 style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:30px\">Brian Harpole</h1><div style=\"color:#cbd5e1\">Private-security professional</div></div></div><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;line-height:1.6;color:#e2e8f0\">Brian Harpole runs Integrity Security Solutions and served as the head of Charlie Kirk’s contracted security team. In April 2026 he filed a federal defamation action against Candace Owens and related defendants. The allegations remain allegations; this graph does not represent a merits finding.</p></article>",
